<title>USA: Nev. housing bonds repriced, top yield 6.35 pct.</title>
<headline>Nev. housing bonds repriced, top yield 6.35 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co said Thursday it repriced $30 million Nevada Housing Division bonds, adjusting yields in several maturities and leaving the top yield in 2028 unchanged at 6.35 percent.</p>
